sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant C as Analytics Page
  participant A as Express API
  participant DB as MongoDB
  U->>C: Open Analytics dashboard
  C->>A: GET /api/songs/analytics/me
  A->>DB: query ListeningHistory for this user
  DB-->>A: playback records
  A->>A: aggregate hours, top genre and artist
  A->>A: build weekly trend, genre split, hourly split
  A->>A: compute recently played and listening streak
  A-->>C: 200 with prepared statistics
  C->>C: render hero cards with count-up
  C->>C: draw area, donut and bar charts
  C-->>U: Display cinematic analytics dashboard
